&gt;&gt; Trace: BREAKING NEWS.

00:00:07.545 --> 00:00:10.023
SUPREME COURT THAT’S THROWN A

00:00:10.057 --> 00:00:10.970
CHALLENGE TO CALIFORNIA’S

00:00:11.005 --> 00:00:12.409
RESTRICTIONS ON RELIGIOUS

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:13.849
GATHERING BACK TO THE LOWER

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:14.935
COURTS FOR RECONSIDERATION.

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:16.472
REMEMBER, THE SUPREME COURT

00:00:16.507 --> 00:00:19.550
JUST RULED A SHORT TIME AGO IN

00:00:19.551 --> 00:00:21.354
FAVOR OF NEW YORK SAYING THEY

00:00:21.355 --> 00:00:22.532
COULD NOT PROHIBIT DIFFERENT

00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:23.778
SIZES OF CROWDS AT CHURCHES.

00:00:23.811 --> 00:00:25.265
WELL NOW WHAT THE SUPREME COURT

00:00:25.266 --> 00:00:27.811
IS SAYING IS THEY ARE THROWING

00:00:27.812 --> 00:00:30.601
IT BACK TO A LOWER COURT TO

00:00:30.602 --> 00:00:31.971
HAVE THEM RECONSIDER WHETHER

00:00:31.973 --> 00:00:34.311
THE STATE CAN DICTATE HOW BIG

00:00:34.345 --> 00:00:35.804
CHURCH CROWDS CAN BE.

00:00:35.838 --> 00:00:37.260
THIS IS IMPORTANT BECAUSE IT

00:00:37.261 --> 00:00:39.445
NOW MANDATES THAT THE LOWER

00:00:39.446 --> 00:00:42.563
COURT TAKE A LOOK AT THIS AGAIN.

00:00:42.564 --> 00:00:43.984
IT KEEPS THE MANDATE BY

00:00:44.019 --> 00:00:45.760
CALIFORNIA IN PLACE BUT AGAIN

00:00:45.794 --> 00:00:48.373
THIS WILL PUT IT AT THE TOP OF

00:00:48.408 --> 00:00:50.855
THE TO DO LIST ON THE LOWER

00:00:50.856 --> 00:00:52.239
COURTS TO GET THIS RULING OUT

00:00:52.274 --> 00:00:53.295
IN SHORT ORDER.

00:00:53.297 --> 00:00:55.806
WE’LL HAVE MORE ON THIS AS IT

00:00:55.807 --> 00:00:58.549
COMES IN TO "AMERICA’S

00:00:58.550 --> 00:00:59.420
NEWSROOM."

00:00:59.454 --> 00:01:01.381
&gt;&gt; Sandra: KENTUCKY’S ATTORNEY

00:01:01.416 --> 00:01:02.481
GENERAL AND PRIVATE CHRISTIAN

00:01:02.515 --> 00:01:03.886
SCHOOL FILED AN EMERGENCY

00:01:03.921 --> 00:01:06.215
REQUEST WITH THE SUPREME COURT

00:01:06.217 --> 00:01:07.733
TRYING TO OVERTURN THE

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:08.968
DEMOCRATIC GOVERNOR’S EXECUTIVE

00:01:09.003 --> 00:01:11.482
ORDER TO SHUT ALL SCHOOLS DOWN.

00:01:11.484 --> 00:01:13.151
JOINING US NOW IS ROGER BYRON,

00:01:13.185 --> 00:01:14.030
THE ATTORNEY FOR DANVILLE

00:01:14.031 --> 00:01:15.022
CHRISTIAN SCHOOL.

00:01:15.023 --> 00:01:17.098
THANK YOU FOR BEING HERE THIS

00:01:17.099 --> 00:01:18.205
MORNING, SIR.

00:01:18.207 --> 00:01:21.051
SO THE KENTUCKY ATTORNEY

00:01:21.085 --> 00:01:22.836
GENERAL IS ARGUING THAT PRIVATE

00:01:22.837 --> 00:01:24.865
RELIGIOUS SCHOOLS SHOULD BE

00:01:24.899 --> 00:01:27.824
ALLOWED TO BE OPEN UNDER THE

00:01:27.825 --> 00:01:29.219
GOVERNOR’S CURRENT ORDERS.

00:01:29.253 --> 00:01:29.843
WHY?

00:01:29.877 --> 00:01:32.711
&gt;&gt; THE FIRST AMENDMENT

00:01:32.712 --> 00:01:34.145
GENERALLY REQUIRES A GOVERNMENT

00:01:34.146 --> 00:01:36.220
TO TREAT RELIGIOUS GATHERINGS

00:01:36.255 --> 00:01:38.652
OF PEOPLE AS WELL AS IT TREATS

00:01:38.686 --> 00:01:39.566
OTHER GATHERINGS.

00:01:39.567 --> 00:01:41.824
IN A COVID-19 CONTEXT THIS

00:01:41.859 --> 00:01:44.811
MEANS THAT A GOVERNMENT CAN

00:01:44.846 --> 00:01:47.199
ALMOST NEVER APPLY RESTRICTIONS

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.957
TO RELIGIOUS GATHERINGS THAT

00:01:48.992 --> 00:01:50.339
DOESN’T ALSO APPLY TO OTHER

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:50.836
GATHERINGS.

00:01:50.838 --> 00:01:52.777
THINGS LIKE GOING TO THE

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:54.770
MOVIES, SHOPPING AT A RETAIL

00:01:54.771 --> 00:01:58.120
CENTER OR A SHOPPING MALL,

00:01:58.154 --> 00:02:00.766
GOING TO WORK IN AN OFFICE OR

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:02.274
FACTORY.

00:02:02.275 --> 00:02:05.928
ALMOST EVERYTHING IS ALLOWED IN

00:02:05.929 --> 00:02:06.317
PERSON.

00:02:06.318 --> 00:02:07.636
BUT PRIVATE RELIGIOUS K-12

00:02:07.637 --> 00:02:10.344
SCHOOLS HAVE BEEN CLOSED.

00:02:10.378 --> 00:02:12.550
&gt;&gt; Sandra: I ARE READ THE

00:02:12.584 --> 00:02:13.213
LAWSUIT.

00:02:13.247 --> 00:02:15.606
IN KENTUCKY ONE CAN CATCH A

00:02:15.608 --> 00:02:19.274
MATINEE AT THE MOVIE THEATER.

00:02:19.276 --> 00:02:22.215
WORK OUT AT THE GYM.

00:02:22.248 --> 00:02:24.373
GO TO A GAMBLING PARTY AND

00:02:24.407 --> 00:02:25.700
ATTEND A WEDDING.

00:02:25.734 --> 00:02:28.070
A PARENT CAN SEND HIS OR HER

00:02:28.104 --> 00:02:29.880
CHILD TO DAYCARE AND PRE-SCHOOL

00:02:29.914 --> 00:02:31.573
AND COLLEGE STUDENTS CAN ATTEND

00:02:31.608 --> 00:02:35.539
CLASSES BUT ALL OF KENTUCKY’S

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:37.169
RELIGIOUS SCHOOLS ARE SHUTTERED

00:02:37.204 --> 00:02:40.398
THERE HAS BEEN A RESPONSE FROM

00:02:40.399 --> 00:02:42.064
THE U.S. COURT OF APPEALS.

00:02:42.065 --> 00:02:43.114
IT SAID THE GOVERNOR’S RULING

00:02:43.149 --> 00:02:43.744
CAN STAND.

00:02:43.746 --> 00:02:45.837
THE STATEMENT FROM THE GOVERNOR.

00:02:45.872 --> 00:02:47.762
WHILE WE ALL WANT TO GET OUR

00:02:47.763 --> 00:02:49.324
KIDS BACK TO IN-PERSON

00:02:49.325 --> 00:02:52.229
INSTRUCTION, THE UNITED STATES

00:02:52.231 --> 00:02:55.240
COURT OF APPEALS FOR THE SIXTH

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:56.967
CIRCUIT RECOGNIZED IT WOULD

00:02:56.968 --> 00:02:58.713
ENDANGER THE LIVES OF KENTUCKY

00:02:58.748 --> 00:02:59.485
CHILDREN, EDUCATORS AND

00:02:59.520 --> 00:02:59.984
FAMILIES.

00:02:59.986 --> 00:03:02.318
DO YOU FURTHER CHALLENGE WHAT

00:03:02.319 --> 00:03:03.966
NOTION BASED ON THE FACT YOU

00:03:03.967 --> 00:03:05.441
HAVE DR. ANTHONY FAUCI SAYING

00:03:05.442 --> 00:03:06.864
WE HAVE TO GET THE KIDS BACK IN

00:03:06.898 --> 00:03:07.379
SCHOOLS?

00:03:07.413 --> 00:03:09.609
THERE IS NO EVIDENCE THAT KIDS

00:03:09.610 --> 00:03:11.571
ARE SPREADING THIS WHEN THEY’RE

00:03:11.572 --> 00:03:12.305
IN THE CLASSROOM?

00:03:12.339 --> 00:03:13.168
&gt;&gt; CERTAINLY.

00:03:13.169 --> 00:03:15.015
IN KENTUCKY RIGHT NOW UNDER THE

00:03:15.049 --> 00:03:16.601
GOVERNOR’S ORDERS THE SAME

00:03:16.602 --> 00:03:18.049
GROUP OF PEOPLE COULD ATTEND A

00:03:18.083 --> 00:03:19.749
FRIEND’S WEDDING AND THEN HEAD

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.029
TO THE GYM TOGETHER FOR A

00:03:21.063 --> 00:03:21.522
WORK-OUT.

00:03:21.523 --> 00:03:23.222
AFTERWARDS THEY COULD CATCH A

00:03:23.223 --> 00:03:24.984
MATINEE AT THE MOVIE, THEY

00:03:24.985 --> 00:03:27.357
COULD ATTEND A CONCERT OR AS

00:03:27.358 --> 00:03:29.297
YOU SAID THEY COULD ATTEND A

00:03:29.299 --> 00:03:30.764
U.K. BASKETBALL GAME WITH

00:03:30.765 --> 00:03:32.462
THOUSANDS OF OTHER PEOPLE IF

00:03:32.463 --> 00:03:33.736
THE ARENA AND SWING BY THE

00:03:33.737 --> 00:03:34.663
LIQUOR STORE.

00:03:34.664 --> 00:03:36.643
IF THEY WANTED THEY COULD GET A

00:03:36.645 --> 00:03:37.261
TATTOO.

00:03:37.295 --> 00:03:39.012
THEY COULD FINISH OFF THEIR

00:03:39.013 --> 00:03:40.978
NIGHT AT THE INDOOR GAMBLING

00:03:41.012 --> 00:03:42.374
SLOT MACHINES DOWN AT THE HORSE

00:03:42.409 --> 00:03:42.980
TRACKS.

00:03:42.981 --> 00:03:44.767
WHAT CAN THEY NOT DO?

00:03:44.801 --> 00:03:47.921
THEY CANNOT ATTEND A BIBLE

00:03:47.955 --> 00:03:49.658
CLASS AT A PRIVATE RELIGIOUS

00:03:49.692 --> 00:03:50.060
SCHOOL.

00:03:50.061 --> 00:03:51.466
THAT IS NOT WHAT THE FIRST

00:03:51.467 --> 00:03:53.041
AMENDMENT REQUIRES.

00:03:53.042 --> 00:03:55.388
&gt;&gt; Sandra: WE KNOW THAT JUSTICE

00:03:55.390 --> 00:03:56.864
BRETT KAVANAUGH WHO WILL

00:03:56.898 --> 00:03:58.454
CONSIDER THE FILING ASKED THE

00:03:58.455 --> 00:03:59.796
GOVERNOR TO FILE A RESPONSE BY

00:03:59.798 --> 00:04:00.353
